# Stone's method: sketch the dissection with unknown sides and let the
# geometry solve them. Each group names the squares it hangs under, left to
# right, so the sketch carries its own topology. The solver scales the
# one-dimensional solution to whole numbers.
.view both
title Order 9 solved from a sketch

